      "statement": "LlmConfiguration is a five-component record (platform, modelName, seed, temperature, environment) whose environment component carries the EnvironmentProvider supplying credentials and host URLs; its defaults are DEFAULT_SEED = 133742243 and DEFAULT_TEMPERATURE = 0.0, and LlmConfiguration.of(platform, modelName) and builder(platform) are its two construction paths.",
