      "id": "claim_c4a6c074d0974473ae0bdd9bf827bfef",
      "statement": "The BIFROST chat branch reads its settings through the shared edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.llm.util.Bifrost helper rather than inline variable names: BIFROST_API_KEY (the Bifrost virtual key) and BIFROST_URL are both required and resolved eagerly via getenvNonNull, the same key is sent both as the OpenAI bearer token and as the custom x-bf-vk header, and the OpenAI-compatible OpenAiChatModel client is built at BIFROST_URL with the configured provider-prefixed model name (for example openai/gpt-4o-mini), seed, temperature, and a 10-minute timeout.",
